<p class="govuk-body">
You can now call an API using the <code>access_token</code> we issued. Do this with an authorisation header containing this <code>access_token</code> as an OAuth 2.0 Bearer Token 
</p>

<h3 class="govuk-heading-s">Example request</h3>

<pre>
<code>
curl -X GET <%= @api_base_url %>/hello/user \
-H "Accept: application/json" \
-H "Authorization: Bearer [ACCESS-TOKEN]"
</code>
</pre>

<%= govuk_notification_banner(title_text: "Note") do %>
  <p>
defer this section until we have the <code>/hello</code> API to reference
  </p>
<% end %>

